# Disaster Recovery — Cloud-Init SSH Key Injection

## Purpose

Standalone recovery script that generates a cloud-init ISO with SSH public key injection and attaches it to a Libvirt VM. Used to restore access when password-based auth is lost or SSH keys are compromised.

**Independent of News Intelligence.** Designed for homelab VM recovery workflows.

## Prerequisites (PopOS)

```bash
# Install once
sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install -y \
  qemu-utils genisoimage cloud-image-utils libvirt-clients bridge-utils \
  python3-pexpect sshpass

# Verify
which cloud-localds virsh cloud-img qemu-img pexpect
```

